<title>INDONESIA: Barito 9-mth net rises slightly.</title>
<headline>Barito 9-mth net rises slightly.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			     (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			62.2 vs 59.3</p>
<p>    Net sales			683.8 vs 605.4</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)   44 vs 42</p>
<p>    Operating profit		46.8 vs 22.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 103.5 vs 90.2</p>
<p>Note: PT Barito Pacific Timber is one of Indonesia's largest timber firms.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
